        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build it. Play it. Share it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tamako is a creative singleplayer or local co-op puzzle platformer where building the level is just as fun as playing it. Work together in local co-op to solve clever challenges—or design your own using the built-in level editor and share them on the Steam Workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through developer-made puzzles or dive into a growing library of community creations. Whether you're crafting devious traps or charming obstacle courses, Tamako gives you the tools to bring your ideas to life—no experience required.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Levels:</strong> An easy-to-use in-game editor lets you design puzzles and playtest them instantly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/ae681f3d376b7da8e202ced1a9f1cfbd.poster.avif?t=1755532499\" width=480 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/ae681f3d376b7da8e202ced1a9f1cfbd.webm?t=1755532499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/ae681f3d376b7da8e202ced1a9f1cfbd.mp4?t=1755532499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Puzzle Platforming:</strong> Solve bite-sized challenges built around teamwork, timing, and experimentation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/8bb0bfc3009f6f770f7911ac502c1f9e.poster.avif?t=1755532499\" width=480 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/8bb0bfc3009f6f770f7911ac502c1f9e.webm?t=1755532499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/8bb0bfc3009f6f770f7911ac502c1f9e.mp4?t=1755532499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local 2-Player Co-op:</strong> Designed for shared play, with intuitive controls and relaxed pacing that’s perfect for casual sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop Support:</strong> Publish your creations or browse community-made levels from around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> With new levels just a click away, there’s always a new puzzle to solve—or a new idea to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/834ac8dce5637c23f38f454e59576e8b.poster.avif?t=1755532499\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/834ac8dce5637c23f38f454e59576e8b.webm?t=1755532499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/834ac8dce5637c23f38f454e59576e8b.mp4?t=1755532499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tamako is the perfect pick-up-and-play platformer for puzzle lovers, creative minds, and players who love building as much as solving.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build it. Play it. Share it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tamako is a creative singleplayer or local co-op puzzle platformer where building the level is just as fun as playing it. Work together in local co-op to solve clever challenges—or design your own using the built-in level editor and share them on the Steam Workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through developer-made puzzles or dive into a growing library of community creations. Whether you're crafting devious traps or charming obstacle courses, Tamako gives you the tools to bring your ideas to life—no experience required.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Levels:</strong> An easy-to-use in-game editor lets you design puzzles and playtest them instantly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/ae681f3d376b7da8e202ced1a9f1cfbd.poster.avif?t=1755532499\" width=480 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/ae681f3d376b7da8e202ced1a9f1cfbd.webm?t=1755532499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/ae681f3d376b7da8e202ced1a9f1cfbd.mp4?t=1755532499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Puzzle Platforming:</strong> Solve bite-sized challenges built around teamwork, timing, and experimentation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/8bb0bfc3009f6f770f7911ac502c1f9e.poster.avif?t=1755532499\" width=480 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/8bb0bfc3009f6f770f7911ac502c1f9e.webm?t=1755532499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/8bb0bfc3009f6f770f7911ac502c1f9e.mp4?t=1755532499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local 2-Player Co-op:</strong> Designed for shared play, with intuitive controls and relaxed pacing that’s perfect for casual sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop Support:</strong> Publish your creations or browse community-made levels from around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> With new levels just a click away, there’s always a new puzzle to solve—or a new idea to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/834ac8dce5637c23f38f454e59576e8b.poster.avif?t=1755532499\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/834ac8dce5637c23f38f454e59576e8b.webm?t=1755532499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875340/extras/834ac8dce5637c23f38f454e59576e8b.mp4?t=1755532499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tamako is the perfect pick-up-and-play platformer for puzzle lovers, creative minds, and players who love building as much as solving.</p>",
